Representation of knowledge that has been developed in most existing applications using conventional methods have limitations. With the ontology system, knowledge management will be developed more expressive than conventional methods. And this ontology system are expected to exploit the richness and variety of fruits and plants to be used as a herbal medicine.
The results of this research is an ontology model of fruit and medicinal plants in the protA©gA© made in the 2 class which are class fruit and medicinal plants that have a subclass of plant names and plant families as well as the class of diseases that have 18 subclasses disease categories that will be the basis of a representation knowledge management.', 0, 'OPENALEX', '{"openalex": "https://openalex.org/W2322162055"}', 'NEEDS_REVIEW', 'openalex_20260709T173707Z', '2026-07-17 13:49:46.262812+00', '2026-07-17 13:49:46.262812+00');
There are some steps for finishing this research, such as topology design, configuration and address allocation, simulation, and analysis. The first step in this research is designing a network topology of oil and gas Company called NUSAMIGAS which implementing EIGRP routing protocol and IPv6 addressing. The next step, is implementing EIGRP routing protocol and IPv6 addressing to all network devices. The last step in this research is execute the simulation and analysis to observe the effect of EIGRPâ��s parameters when using the best routes to reach network destination.
Based on this simulation and analysis that has been done in NUSAMIGAS network topology, there are some important result. The time for EIGRP to reach the convergent states is 30,280 second. The best route that used by EIGRP routing protocol to reach destination is effected by bandwidth and delay parameters. Reliability and load parameters are not tested in this research. EIGRP choose the best route which has the smallest metric with the biggest bandwidth and the minimum delay accumulations. EIGRP also used feasible distance, successor, feasible successor, and reported distance to choose the best routes to reach destination.', 0, 'OPENALEX', '{"openalex": "https://openalex.org/W2335861898"}', 'NEEDS_REVIEW', 'openalex_20260709T173707Z', '2026-07-17 13:49:46.262812+00', '2026-07-17 13:49:46.262812+00');
the body for a 40-year-old. With the arising complaints and illnesses, the world of
