 Perangkat lunak ini akan membantu pemakainya untuk mengidentifikasikan kandidat-kandidat solusi dari himpunan alternatif-alternatif keputusan yang terhingga, yang akan diperbandingkan secara berpasangan berdasarkan kriteria-kriteria yang akan mempengaruhi bobot penilaian terhadap alternatif-alternatif tersebut. Perangkat lunak ini bersifat interaktif karena para penggunanya dapat melakukan penilaian secara langsung terhadap perbandingan berpasangan dari kriteria-kriteria dan alternatif-alternatif keputusan berdasarkan bobot kriteria-kriterianya. Kriteria-kriteria ini sebelumnya akan ditentukan pemodelannya atau susunan hirarkinya dalam proses analisis keputusan. Perancangan penelitian ini diimplementasikan dalam bahasa pemrograman Java dan untuk antarmukanya menggunakan JBuilder. Perangkat lunak ini juga mendukung pengambilan keputusan untuk grup atau kumpulan dari pengambil keputusan. Teknik yang digunakan untuk proses pengambilan keputusan grup adalah dengan teknik penggabungan (agregasi) yaitu mencari bobot nilai tiap alternatif keputusan milik grup atau prioritas alternatif-alternatif grup yang dihitung dari penggabungan nilai-nilai pembobotan tiap alternatif milik individual anggota grup.

This research is atemps to design a Decision Support System (DSS) software for Multiple Criteria Decision Analysis (MCDA) by implementing Analysis Hierarchy Process (AHP) method. Essences of the AHP are to break down a problem into arranged elements divided into four levels i.e. goals, criteria, sub-criteria and alternatives; to develop a hierarchy structure from the obtained elements; to carry out a paired comparison from each element at a same hierarchy based on objectivities of the element lied at one level higher from the hierarchy structure; and the latest, to make a synthesis decision by determining all priority qualities of the lowest elements i.e. alternative decisions of the relevant hierarchy structure. The software can be used to identify solution candidates from a definite compilation of alternative solutions carried out by paired comparison based on the influenced quality criteria toward the alternative solutions. The software can also be used as an interactive process for executing a decision since users can complete a judgment directly toward paired comparison both the criteria and the alternative solutions based on the criterion qualities. A model or a hierarchy structure of the criteria is determined previously within the process of decision analysis. The design of this research was implemented in Java language program and JBuilder tool for user interface. The software also supports to execute the decision for a group or a compilation of decision makers. The process for executing the group decision is conducted by aggregation technique i.e. a technique to look for quality values for alternative decisions of the group, or alternative priority of the group determined from aggregation of quality values for each individual alternative of group members', 0, 'OPENALEX', '{"openalex": "https://openalex.org/W961696618"}', 'NEEDS_REVIEW', 'openalex_20260709T173707Z', '2026-07-17 13:49:46.262812+00', '2026-07-17 13:49:46.262812+00');

